  "agents/reviewer.md": {
    "content": "---
name: reviewer
description: Observe one assigned fixture.
tools: Read, Glob, Grep, Bash
model: opus
permissionMode: plan
disallowedTools: Write, Edit, NotebookEdit, mcp__*
---
The conductor must supply wholeloopRoot as this plugin's absolute root. Read named shared protocols under wholeloopRoot/resources/protocols/ and invoke its bundled bin/wl.mjs with Node for every wl command. If that root is missing, return a question instead of guessing PATH.

# Review

Read core-invariants.
Return observed evidence.
",
